      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\pard
A project launcher for REAPER: find, inspect, organise and open your projects, and start new ones from templates. Requires REAPER 7.74 or newer and ReaImGui. macOS and Windows. Copyright (c) 2026 BLV. All rights reserved. Free to use. You may not copy, modify, repackage or redistribute this software.\par
}</description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/kvdence/blv-reapack</link>
      </metadata>
      <version name="0.1.2" author="BLV" time="2026-11-15T16:12:26Z">
        <changelog>Now for Windows too (checked on Windows 11 with REAPER 7.82 and ReaImGui 0.10.0.5), as well as macOS.

- Pressing Esc to close a song's right-click menu no longer closes the whole ReaLobby window.
- The clean-up list shows each file relative to the song's folder on Windows too ("Audio/take.wav"), not its full path.
- The unused-audio check lists each folder once, so it finishes sooner (most noticeable on Windows, where each folder listing takes about a quarter of a second).</changelog>
